~ start

match interaction_count
	when 1
		PLUM: Do I have to comment about everything? (tired)
		VINCENT: No. You don't have to comment about anything.
		PLUM: My friend sent me a joke in the mail. (happy)
		PLUM: Took me a few days to get it. (silly)
		VINCENT: I really meant it when I said no. (serious)
		=> END

	when 2
		PLUM: Did you hear about the stamped letter? (silly)
		PLUM: You wouldn't get it. (happy)
		VINCENT: The joke is an unstamped letter. (angry)
		PLUM: Whatever... (angry)
		=> END

	else
		PLUM: I'm done... (tired)
		=> END